      {
        "author_name": "Noozah Ansari",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105154741293603635240/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLTPUdj3KDYl13D4t1QYBe876CJIWHM9Iczegn0xKnq7-jl1w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Amazing photographer, very patient and understands her work. It's not just about getting paid but also about pleasing her customer. Very very happy.",
        "time": 1624148329,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Valerie courtemanche",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118267391801354967308/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIKRhDdddnvQe2B0LDOpRc-zvY4tJb9oNJRSnkyEz9BThgZcQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We chose Carrément Photo for our newborn photoshoot and are very happy with our choice! Emilie took the time to show us the studio and the different options before we booked. She was available throughout the holidays for our unborn baby. During the session, she was remarkably gentle and calm. Her professionalism is outstanding, and the results of the session are truly satisfying. I would definitely use her services again in the future.",
        "time": 1737412202,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Karine Simard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108736106030009359307/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIBTscl0He4FoAZsqHnuzla4lLiSXpl2nr-oUGgI2sQHbbqtQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "What more can I say than Emilie is incredible 😀 We trusted her for maternity photos, baby photos of our two little ones and two Christmas photos now. She puts us at ease, takes the time with each family, and makes the experience completely enjoyable and personalized. The rates are very reasonable and lots of options are available. Don't hesitate to trust her. See you next year, Emilie!",
        "time": 1732632379,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Melody Menard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117537802404801975579/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKvpFmK1VIq6q9JvJlVuzZMLxA7LSyY83Fx0doGznCQI175=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "After two weeks of searching online for a professional newborn photographer, we found Émilie from Carrément Photo. We met her in person and instantly connected! She's a true gem. So, we decided to hire her for our newborn photoshoot. We weren't disappointed at all. Her professionalism, talent, attentiveness, etc. We loved her. And the photos? Just wow.\nDon't hesitate to contact her for your photoshoots. You won't be disappointed. We've found our photographer for our events.\n\nThank you, Carrément Photo!",
        "time": 1735857247,
        "translated": true
      }
